\caption(Response-only validation loss and exact held-out generation before and after fine-tuning.)
\alttext(A line chart shows validation loss by epoch. A point chart compares the number of exact responses for each instruction.)

Validation response loss dropped after fine-tuning. The three-epoch
run still produced zero complete correct responses on all three commands.
